     and build upon is the thing section 3.1 prohibits, wearing a different hat.
     Send it back under 2.6.

2.6  Modify the Software, and create the copy or fork your code-hosting platform
     requires, **solely** to prepare a change you submit to the Official
     Repository.

     This permission is for the act of contributing. It ends when the
     contribution is submitted, withdrawn or rejected, and it never extends to
     running that copy in production, distributing it, publishing it as an
     alternative to the Software, or keeping it as an independent line of
